WEBVTT

00:00:05.384 --> 00:00:07.211
[grunting]

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:16.612
Well done, students... if you
were trying to disappoint me.
招式漂亮 徒弟
只可惜令人失望

00:00:16.743 --> 00:00:19.833
Tigress, you need more ferocity!
Monkey, greater speed.
虎妞 不够猛
猴王 速度太慢

00:00:19.963 --> 00:00:22.618
Crane, height.
Viper, subtlety. Mantis...
灵鹤 飞不够高
俏小龙 不够细心 快螳螂…

00:00:22.749 --> 00:00:24.707
- Master Shifu. Aah!
- What?!
师傅！
干嘛？

00:00:24.838 --> 00:00:27.319
It's Master Oogway.
He wants to see you.
是…乌龟大师 他要见你

00:00:31.888 --> 00:00:36.458
[panting, exhaling slowly]

00:00:38.199 --> 00:00:41.681
Master Oogway, you summoned me?
Is something wrong?
乌龟大师 你找我？
发生什么事了吗？

00:00:47.991 --> 00:00:52.213
Why must something be wrong for
me to want to see my old friend?
没事不能找你吗 老友？

00:00:52.344 --> 00:00:54.476
So, nothing's wrong?
所以没事？

00:00:54.607 --> 00:00:57.349
Well, I didn't say that.
这个嘛…我没这样说

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:04.834
[continues
blowing out candles]

00:01:15.671 --> 00:01:20.023
- You were saying?
- I have had a vision.
我有预感

00:01:20.154 --> 00:01:23.070
Tai Lung will return.
残豹会回来

00:01:24.288 --> 00:01:27.161
[growling]

00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:30.382
That is impossible!
He is in prison.
不可能 他被关在大牢

00:01:30.512 --> 00:01:33.080
Nothing is impossible.
世上没有不可能的事

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:37.171
Zeng! Fly to Chorh-Gom prison
and tell them
快飞去长顺大牢！

00:01:37.301 --> 00:01:40.827
to double the guards,
double their weapons,
double everything!
叫他们加倍守卫人数！
加倍武装！加倍所有防备！

00:01:40.957 --> 00:01:42.872
Tai Lung does not
leave that prison!
千万不能让残豹逃出来！

00:01:43.003 --> 00:01:46.049
Yes, Master Shifu!
[squawks]
遵命 师傅

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:51.446
One often meets his destiny on
the road he takes to avoid it.
人永远无法逃避宿命

00:01:51.577 --> 00:01:55.363
We have to do something!
We can't let him march on
the valley, take his revenge!
我们必须想办法…
不能让他回来和平谷展开复仇！

00:01:55.494 --> 00:01:58.975
- He'll...
- Your mind is like
this water, my friend.
你的思绪就像这水面 朋友

00:01:59.106 --> 00:02:02.457
When it is agitated,
it becomes difficult to see.
一旦起了涟漪 就很难看清楚

00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:05.982
But if you
allow it to settle...
但只要平心静气

00:02:06.113 --> 00:02:08.898
...the answer becomes clear.
一切就能昭然若揭

00:02:11.858 --> 00:02:13.947
[Shifu]
The Dragon Scroll.
神龙秘笈

00:02:14.643 --> 00:02:16.210
It is time.
是时候了

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:18.255
But who?
Who is worthy
不过是谁呢？
谁值得托付无极神功秘诀？

00:02:18.386 --> 00:02:20.997
to be trusted with
the secret to limitless power?
不过是谁呢？
谁值得托付无极神功秘诀？

00:02:21.128 --> 00:02:25.698
To become
the Dragon Warrior?
有资格成为…神龙大侠呢？

00:02:25.828 --> 00:02:28.918
I don't know.
我也不知道

00:02:29.049 --> 00:02:31.834
Excuse me. Pardon me. Sorry.
借过 不好意思…

00:02:31.965 --> 00:02:34.489
- Hey, watch it, Po!
- Sorry. Suck it up!
抱歉 缩小腹！

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:35.882
- [babies crying]
- Oh!
抱歉 缩小腹！

00:02:36.012 --> 00:02:38.580
Sorry. A thousand pardons.
抱歉 真够抱歉

00:02:38.711 --> 00:02:41.714
- [gong sounding]
- What?
什么？

00:02:41.844 --> 00:02:45.239
Master Oogway's choosing
the Dragon Warrior! Today!
乌龟大师要挑出神龙大侠
就是今天！

00:02:45.369 --> 00:02:47.807
Everyone! Everyone! Go!
Get to the Jade Palace!
大伙儿！大伙儿！
快 快去玉皇宫！

00:02:47.937 --> 00:02:49.939
One of the Five is gonna
get the Dragon Scroll!
盖世五侠之一
将会获得神龙秘笈！

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:53.073
We've been waiting 1,000 years
for this! Just take the bowl!
我们已经等了一千年了！
把面带去吃吧！

00:02:53.203 --> 00:02:57.251
This is the greatest day
in kung fu history! Just go!
这是武林最大条的事
不用小费啦 快点去

00:02:57.381 --> 00:03:00.123
[man]
Po! Where are you going?
阿波！你要去哪里？

00:03:00.254 --> 00:03:02.474
To the Jade Palace.
去…玉皇宫

00:03:02.604 --> 00:03:04.911
But you're forgetting
your noodle cart.
别忘了带面条推车

00:03:05.041 --> 00:03:06.913
The whole valley
will be there,
所有和平谷的居民都会去看
你可以卖面大赚一笔

00:03:07.043 --> 00:03:09.524
and you'll sell noodles
to all of them.
所有和平谷的居民都会去看
你可以卖面大赚一笔

00:03:09.655 --> 00:03:11.221
Selling noodles?
卖面？

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.878
But, Dad, you know,
I was kinda thinking, maybe I...
可是老爸…我在想…或许我…

00:03:16.009 --> 00:03:18.402
- Yeah?
- I was kinda
thinking maybe I...
什么？
我在想或许我…

00:03:18.533 --> 00:03:22.058
Uh-huh?
怎样？

00:03:22.189 --> 00:03:26.715
...could also sell the bean
buns. They're about to go bad.
也能卖豆沙包
包子…再不卖就要过期了

00:03:26.846 --> 00:03:28.500
That's my boy!
好样的

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.806
I told you that dream
was a sign.
我就说那场梦是个好兆头

00:03:30.937 --> 00:03:34.027
Yeah. [chuckles]
Glad I had it.
是啊 哈哈 真是好梦

00:03:34.157 --> 00:03:36.290
[up-tempo music plays]

00:03:38.118 --> 00:03:40.294
- I'm a kung fu warrior!
- Me, too!
我是功夫侠士！
我也是！

00:03:40.424 --> 00:03:43.253
- There's spots at the top.
- Let's go.

00:03:55.875 --> 00:03:57.877
- [gulps]
- [grunting]

00:03:58.007 --> 00:03:59.313
[wheels squeaking]

00:04:14.241 --> 00:04:16.156
[grunting, panting]

00:04:17.505 --> 00:04:20.290
Come on. Come on!
加油 我可以的

00:04:20.421 --> 00:04:22.205
Almost there.
快到了

00:04:22.336 --> 00:04:23.424
What?
什么？

00:04:23.555 --> 00:04:26.427
No! Oh, no!
不会吧！不会吧！

00:04:28.516 --> 00:04:32.346
- Sorry, Po.
- We'll bring you back
a souvenir.
真可怜 阿波
我们会帮你拿纪念品

00:04:36.568 --> 00:04:40.267
No. I'll bring me back
a souvenir.
不 我要自己去拿纪念品

00:04:45.359 --> 00:04:48.536
It is an historic day.
Isn't it, Master Oogway?
没错吧 乌龟大师？

00:04:48.667 --> 00:04:53.454
Yes, and one I feared
I would not live to see.
没错
我还担心我等不到这一天

00:04:53.585 --> 00:04:55.499
Are your students ready?
你的徒弟们准备好了吗？

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.545
Yes, Master Oogway.
好了 乌龟大师

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:00.330
Know this, old friend.
老朋友 你得明白…

00:05:00.461 --> 00:05:04.639
Whomever I choose will not only
bring peace to the valley...
我挑的人…
不仅会为这里带来平静

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:07.555
...but also to you.
也能为你带来平静

00:05:10.993 --> 00:05:16.564
- Let the tournament begin!
- [cheering]
比武大赛开始！

00:05:18.392 --> 00:05:20.568
[grunting]

00:05:24.616 --> 00:05:26.226
[groaning]

00:05:26.356 --> 00:05:28.097
Yeah. [chuckles]
好耶 哈哈！

00:05:28.228 --> 00:05:31.361
- [door creaking]
- Oh, no, no, wait!
不！不！不！等一下！

00:05:31.492 --> 00:05:35.278
I'm coming! Wait, wait! Yes!
我来了啦！等一下！

00:05:38.107 --> 00:05:40.632
Hey! Open the door!
不！别关门！

00:05:42.329 --> 00:05:45.506
Let me in!
让我进去！

00:05:45.637 --> 00:05:48.030
[Shifu]
Citizens of the Valley of Peace,
和平谷的乡亲父老
加油

00:05:48.161 --> 00:05:51.904
it is my great honor
to present to you...Tigress!
我很荣幸介绍…虎妞！

00:05:52.034 --> 00:05:55.995
Viper! Crane! Monkey! Mantis!
俏小龙！灵鹤！猴王！快螳螂！

00:05:56.125 --> 00:05:58.693
- The Furious Five!
- [chortling]
盖世五侠！

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:11.619
Yeah, the Furious Five!
好耶 盖世五侠！

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.882
[grunting]

00:06:14.013 --> 00:06:15.318
[Shifu]
Warriors, prepare!
各位 请准备好

00:06:15.449 --> 00:06:17.581
Wait. No. Oh, peeky-hole.
等一下…有个洞可以偷看

00:06:17.712 --> 00:06:19.627
- [Shifu] Ready for battle!
- Yeah.
比武开始！

00:06:21.498 --> 00:06:24.850
The Thousand Tongues of Fire.
[chuckling]
烽火连天阵

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.982
[man]
Whoa. Look at that.
你看看

00:06:27.113 --> 00:06:28.897
Hey! Get out of the way!
挡到我啦

00:06:29.028 --> 00:06:32.509
Oh!
[laughing]

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.469
[screams, thumping]

00:06:38.951 --> 00:06:40.387
[moaning]

00:06:43.651 --> 00:06:46.393
[grunts] Ow!

00:06:50.353 --> 00:06:51.659
Oh...

00:06:57.317 --> 00:06:59.319
Oh! [groaning]

00:06:59.449 --> 00:07:01.930
[crowd cheering]

00:07:02.061 --> 00:07:05.717
[Shifu] And, finally,
Master Tigress!
最后是…虎妞！

00:07:07.022 --> 00:07:08.894
And believe me, citizens,
相信我
你们还没有见识到真功夫

00:07:09.024 --> 00:07:11.418
you have not seen anything yet.
相信我
你们还没有见识到真功夫

00:07:11.548 --> 00:07:12.767
I know!
那还用说！

00:07:12.898 --> 00:07:14.334
[Shifu] Master Tigress!
虎妞 对抗千手绝命刀铁霸牛！

00:07:14.464 --> 00:07:18.077
Face Iron Ox
and his Blades of Death.
虎妞 对抗千手绝命刀铁霸牛！

00:07:21.384 --> 00:07:23.560
[groans]

00:07:26.346 --> 00:07:27.695
[crowd gasping] Oh!

00:07:30.176 --> 00:07:34.920
I sense the Dragon Warrior
is among us.
我感觉到神龙大侠就在这里

00:07:39.925 --> 00:07:42.362
Citizens of the
Valley of Peace,
和平谷的乡亲父老

00:07:42.492 --> 00:07:47.759
Master Oogway will now choose
the Dragon Warrior!
乌龟大师现在将选出神龙大侠！

00:07:47.889 --> 00:07:50.892
Huh?! Oh, no! No, no, wait!
不！等一下！

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:53.677
Yeah.

00:08:01.947 --> 00:08:03.426
[laughing]

00:08:10.085 --> 00:08:13.132
Po! What are you doing?!
你在干嘛？

00:08:13.262 --> 00:08:15.525
What does it look like
I'm doing?! Stop!
你说呢？别这样！

00:08:15.656 --> 00:08:17.832
I'm going to see
the Dragon Warrior!
我一定要看到神龙大侠！

00:08:21.053 --> 00:08:25.666
But I don't understand. You
finally had the noodle dream!
我不懂 你好不容易梦到面条！

00:08:25.797 --> 00:08:29.191
I lied. I don't dream
about noodles, Dad.
我说谎 我没梦到面条 老爸

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:35.545
I love kung fu!
我热爱功夫！

00:08:45.338 --> 00:08:47.427
[sniffling]

00:08:47.557 --> 00:08:52.562
Oh, come on, son.
Let's get back to work.
走吧 儿子 回去干活儿吧

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:56.566
[sighs deeply] OK.
好吧

00:08:57.219 --> 00:08:59.656
Ahhh!

00:08:59.787 --> 00:09:04.096
Oh! Come back!
回来！

00:09:04.226 --> 00:09:07.708
[screaming]

00:09:09.884 --> 00:09:11.843
[all] Oooh. Ahh.

00:09:11.973 --> 00:09:13.888
[screaming]

00:09:14.019 --> 00:09:15.629
Uh-oh.

00:09:26.335 --> 00:09:26.364
[Po groans]
What's going on?

